---
// The landing page is dark only, so the docs are too. This replaces Starlight's
// ThemeProvider, which would otherwise read a stored light/dark preference or
// the operating system setting. There is no theme selector either (see Empty.astro).
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = "dark";
  window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
